   "html_text": "Barbero (2021) and Barbero et al. (2021) take up the task of investigating fragments of the general syntax of slash logic (not all of whose formulas are in prenex form). Thereby these authors wish to study systematically those expressive resources of slash logic that allow it to exceed the expressive power of ⟦M⟧ and that do not simply derive from its capacity to mimick Henkin quantifiers. While many of the features studied in these two papers depend on the Eigenart of slash logic, the phenomeno",
